{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "a2f45fd9078da128b49d51b8394db1fae9b8b8ceb6606f0629e9fb934d02e3a7", "ja": "ぼくたちだけの合言葉", "zh": "我们之间的暗号", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "1ff0ee6ba1dd3895e0486b0fcc7bdc80d9ea62694906e7543ad7620401ba2bbd", "ja": "今日のミリラジのゲストは亜利沙。「ミリラ\nジの独自挨拶は決まっているか、なければ作\nって欲しい」というおたよりを元に案を出し\n合い「みりっほ～」に決定。誕生日用挨拶も\n決まり、みんなで亜利沙をお祝いする。", "zh": "今天的MILLION RADIO嘉宾是亚利沙。根据“百万电台有没有固定的独特问候语，如果没有的话，希望能创作一个”的来信，大家互相提出方案，最终决定采用“みりっほ～”。生日用的问候语也确定下来，大家一起为亚利沙庆祝生日。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_03_1000_028ari", "source_sha256": "f9b07a82ed0d48ea7ecc3bbd7078d4034d7049420fd77f166fb3124aeab17b73", "ja": "皆さん。765プロライブ劇場の松田亜利沙です。", "zh": "大家好。我是来自765 Pro Live剧场的松田亚利沙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_03_1001_028ari", "source_sha256": "4b4e9cab8d651cb4babdb2c4a839c8dbe8d64844c77e55eb5bf3a535df1cc436", "ja": "今、アイドルちゃんのラジオ収録現場に潜入しています\n……もう収録は始まっているみたいです……ふぉぉ！", "zh": "我现在潜入了偶像们的广播录音现场。\n……录音好像已经开始了……呼哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_03_1002_022ser", "source_sha256": "0bf65e035f996ef5f43526c03cb0418eeb4d4097f5d1d40e76bb34b58ad89949", "ja": "というわけで、今日のゲストはわたし達の仲間、765\nプロライブ劇場の松田亜利沙さんです。こんにちは！", "zh": "所以，今天的嘉宾是我们的伙伴765，来自Pro Live剧场的松田亚利沙先生。您好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_03_1003_014mir", "source_sha256": "b7caff561fd603f638e882225884b8af2cd659134c21e16463cd26c3f3933a29", "ja": "こんにちは～！", "zh": "你好～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_03_1004_015siz", "source_sha256": "b7caff561fd603f638e882225884b8af2cd659134c21e16463cd26c3f3933a29", "ja": "こんにちは～！", "zh": "你好～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_03_1005_028ari", "source_sha256": "90f08b8e61d265bb5f111712e1a8e2c1fe39f56bd61d2698e4b77e74e012c61f", "ja": "『こんにちは』！？", "zh": "“你好”！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_03_1006_022ser", "source_sha256": "e3478b42d0b57c4555d5b8b180fe1a622be02ebd182faa3f5bd01350da41aee2", "ja": "えっ、何か間違っちゃいましたか……？", "zh": "诶，难道是哪里说错了吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_03_1007_028ari", "source_sha256": "4985ab33dcf114cc5fa6b3cf55a5afc24d51d3ea28b99e178c161efe5816b519", "ja": "実はリスナーさんからも、こんな提案をいただいて\nいるんです。ラジオネーム、紅のピーマンさん。", "zh": "其实听众朋友也给我们提了这么个建议。\n电台名，“红青椒”朋友。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_03_1008_028ari", "source_sha256": "0fc2992bf35ac8cf36189091ff65acc4f0517750e71a3e1a578d9bdd769db6e7", "ja": "『アイドルのラジオ番組には番組独自の挨拶があるもの\nですが、ミリラジにはそういうのはないんですか？』", "zh": "“偶像的广播节目里往往都会有专属的打招呼用语，\n但Million广播里没有这样的问候语吗？”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_03_1009_028ari", "source_sha256": "18e676083bfbd78fa99cda65117be598c1767a06462258614e772f55e119f398", "ja": "『なかったら是非作ってほしいです！』と。ちなみに、\nスパーク☆めいでんちゃん達は「こんすぱーく」です。", "zh": "她说：“如果还没有的话，请务必创作一个！”顺便一提，Spark☆女仆们的招呼语是“康斯帕克”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_03_1010_022ser", "source_sha256": "eafa638c2eb9246a28b849a18363de75681710e4395d21b8b4d90ecef71c76d6", "ja": "番組独自の挨拶、そういえば、\nたしかによく聞く気がします。", "zh": "节目独有的问候语，说起来，确实感觉经常能听到呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_03_1011_014mir", "source_sha256": "906b42928dc12b952465bcc2edd3db11188d916cb9f307e7eb8dda67ca0cc371", "ja": "うーん。じゃあ……こんみら～。おつかすが～。\nあっ、なんかいい感じかも！", "zh": "嗯……那就……“未来好～”。“辛苦啦，春日～”。\n啊，感觉好像还挺不错的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_03_1012_015siz", "source_sha256": "b0ed47d70d7278b0f20787724d747b8eaf3c19276eeba86a17f6dbea7887d70d", "ja": "もう、未来の名前しか入ってない。\n3人バラバラじゃ意味ないでしょ？", "zh": "已经只剩未来的名字了。3人各自分开的话，不就没意义了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_03_1013_022ser", "source_sha256": "a53aecf33b6cf9913618883602598f8201f041893bfbb5d7db4ef46db7bca96e", "ja": "おはこざき！　なんて……。\nえへへ、なんでもないです。", "zh": "早上好箱崎！开玩笑的……\n嘿嘿，没什么。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_03_1014_014mir", "source_sha256": "b43f36963c22fffa31d8f443fc9f7e8db459317b741f04c34e83246cc856b0c6", "ja": "みなさん、おはこざき～！\n……あっ、いいよ星梨花、おはこざき、かわいいよ！", "zh": "大家，早安崎～！\n……啊，没事啦星梨花，早安崎很可爱哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_03_1015_015siz", "source_sha256": "03fe313e9dd88f55346bbbfd5b00c251d6342c47ebc6aafc4ab8fc5836229811", "ja": "そうね。星梨花しか入ってないけど、\nかわいいし……。", "zh": "是啊。虽然只有星梨花，  \n但很可爱……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_03_1016_028ari", "source_sha256": "9bc682fb06ad8a0d52f8c1a13a9e5401660ef0f18a389e9352251e219c8cb6cc", "ja": "ふむ……。お約束から外れますが、かわいいですし。\nチャレンジってことでいいと思います！", "zh": "嗯……虽然不符合惯例，但确实很可爱。就当作一次挑战，我觉得也不错！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_03_1017_022ser", "source_sha256": "0514201f722222acf9376f99ed3d24442c7f4a7b80adce977acab597e9c6eaba", "ja": "よ、よくないです！　そんな、かわいいとか……\n何度もいわないでください……。", "zh": "不、不好的！怎么能说可爱什么的……\n请不要一直重复啦……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_03_1018_014mir", "source_sha256": "1f5af0f4eb21b0b2a1f1fc2833782472f5dad6f5de74e825941f6661e3d0f17d", "ja": "え～、だって星梨花かわいいんだもん。\n仕方ないよ～。", "zh": "诶～，因为星梨花很可爱嘛。\n没办法呀～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_03_1019_028ari", "source_sha256": "5a04b006556ae2da3aa1fda0e9ba4e719c2122ddcad9b5da1eca61908c91e303", "ja": "はい、本当にカワイイので仕方ありません。ありさも\n毎日、物陰から見守っていますからね！", "zh": "是的，因为星梨花实在太可爱了，也没办法嘛。亚利沙每天都会躲在暗处守护她的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_03_1020_022ser", "source_sha256": "6ef203907c665e7c8a349bbd9550ea834b05683ad1f03c6f163aaca1542e04e9", "ja": "もう……。とにかく、ダメです！", "zh": "真是的……总之就是不行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_03_1021_015siz", "source_sha256": "2ac2bd4e85ab7192ccf89b1272472ab465c3698a30e5ecf47de1e307764c3123", "ja": "というわけで、いろんな候補がでましたが、\nミリラジのあいさつは「みりっほー」に決定です！", "zh": "所以，虽然提出了各种各样的候选，\n最终决定将百万电台的问候语定为“米莉嗨”！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_03_1022_022ser", "source_sha256": "356682e464fa678d2cbbe44a3b740475968ec19161a5dbfcb0dee41684b0eb7a", "ja": "みりっほ～！　えへへ、なんだか楽しいですね♪", "zh": "米莉嗬～！嘿嘿，总觉得好开心呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_03_1023_014mir", "source_sha256": "fe0fb506fef02043d5382a18a2cef7344a4039b6ab164343302862636c601030", "ja": "私、誕生日のあいさつも思いついたよ！\n「みりはっぴ～！」っていうのはどう？", "zh": "我还想到了生日问候语！\n叫\"未来生日快乐～！\"怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_03_1024_015siz", "source_sha256": "638bf83ee2fa61ffa75ddf5226417020fa0a913ea2ce58c673f449982ca6276b", "ja": "誕生日？　そっか、劇場のアイドルって\nたくさんいるし、使う機会が多いのかも。", "zh": "生日？这样啊，剧场里的偶像\n有很多，可能经常会用到吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_03_1025_028ari", "source_sha256": "b3fa82aeee878763cf7bce9b814ca496bb023268dd3d28b2317e471415014180", "ja": "コホン……。\n実はこの時期、ありさの誕生日がですね……。", "zh": "咳咳……\n其实，这段时间正好是亚利沙的生日……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_03_1026_014mir", "source_sha256": "3cf3c917ebd7ab4b99162f5ab428609d748507fab86cdf973aca211532ca3bd6", "ja": "ああっ、そうだった！\nありさちゃん、おめでとう～！　せーのっ、", "zh": "啊，对了！\n亚利沙，生日快乐～！预备——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_03_1027_014mir", "source_sha256": "1277fa00dee7f34a258fe57fb40b0321451d654273a7008df606166b543fa798", "ja": "みりはっぴ～！", "zh": "百万快乐～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_03_1028_015siz", "source_sha256": "1277fa00dee7f34a258fe57fb40b0321451d654273a7008df606166b543fa798", "ja": "みりはっぴ～！", "zh": "百万快乐～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_03_1029_022ser", "source_sha256": "1277fa00dee7f34a258fe57fb40b0321451d654273a7008df606166b543fa798", "ja": "みりはっぴ～！", "zh": "百万快乐～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_03_1030_028ari", "source_sha256": "c5317d7b9c2136f58b631e29fe7938f6432e6f4b486fdfc00e2342b4d9aa7e34", "ja": "ふぉぉぉっ、ありさがまさかのお祝い第一号に！\nありがとうございます、ありがとうございます～！", "zh": "呼呼呼，没想到亚利沙居然成了第一个送上祝福的人！\n谢谢，谢谢你～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_03_1031_014mir", "source_sha256": "1b5e1d9491eddbbfb05db0308c8b60394a662e56594e95a7145b0bc95ca21065", "ja": "うん、なんかラジオっぽくなってきた！", "zh": "嗯，感觉越来越像做广播了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
